### Test 1: Save - Create (operator user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operatorId": 307,
  "organizationName": "Transportes Andinos S.A.",
  "contactEmail": "operaciones@andinos.com"
}

### Test 2: Save - Update phone and add legal representative
POST {{baseUrl}}/Organization/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": 4354,
  "contactPhone": "+50222223333",
  "contacts": [
    {
      "contactName": "Luis Méndez",
      "email": "luis.mendez@andinos.com",
      "isLegalRepresentative": true
    }
  ]
}

